{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30713","headline":"杭州江亭留题登眺 · 项斯","name":"杭州江亭留题登眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"处处日驰销，凭轩夕似朝。\n渔翁闲鼓櫂，沙鸟戏迎潮。\n树间津亭密，城连坞寺遥。\n因谁报隐者，向此得耕樵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项斯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}